    <parallel-reason>Schema + shared index-lifecycle change (Services/Jobs/Handlers + SearchIndexNameResolver) + AI-Search schema; blocks 035; must not race another schema/index editor; conflict-check with teams-app-r1 + AI cluster.</parallel-reason>
