    <dependencies>020 (P2 entitlement schema) must be complete. 035 (Review Policy Question + Policy Library browse) consumes the sprk_gridconfiguration + governance fields this task creates. 051 (Ask Legal policy_search) grounds on the policy index + governance trim this task builds; the P5 security spike (050) resolves the trim's security requirements — this task builds the trim fields + query filter mechanism.</dependencies>
  </context>
  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">Reuse sprk_document — do NOT create a sprk_policy entity (eliminated 2026-08-06). A policy = a sprk_document of category=Policy. Add sprk_documentcategory as a NEW discriminator optionset (Operational/Policy/Reference-Golden); do NOT overload the single-valued AI-populated sprk_documenttype.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Design the category→index routing + governance-state trim as a GENERAL mechanism (typed document → typed RAG index → typed grid) that Reference-Golden reuses via sprk_analysisknowledge→ReferenceIndexingService→spaarke-rag-references — but BUILD + wire ONLY Policy in R2 (§11: build one excellent path, document the general seam; do not build Reference).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Governance-state trim (status/effective/published) MUST be enforced at QUERY time on the index — add the index fields + a query-time filter so an unpublished/expired/restricted policy NEVER surfaces in retrieval. This is the one genuinely-new plumbing piece; the security requirements are refined by the P5 spike (050) but the field + filter mechanism is built here.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">The Policy Library grid MUST be a sprk_gridconfiguration record (entity=sprk_document, filter category=Policy) read read-only via BffDataverseClient — do NOT hand-roll a grid or a new read endpoint (reuse the DataGrid framework).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-024">Do NOT disturb existing sprk_document relationships/regarding — all additions are additive (new optionset attribute + governance scalar fields).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">BFF addition (index-routing/query change): state the Placement Justification in the PR (cite .claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md); run dotnet publish -c Release and report compressed size + delta vs baseline 46.90 MB incl PDBs (ceiling ≤60 MB); run /conflict-check before the BFF PR (teams-app-r1 shares external-access; AI/indexing cluster shares Services/Jobs + Services/Ai).</constraint>
  </constraints>
