  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Load spec.md FR-25 (line 257) + §12 C + review-additions-analysis.md item 5 + the DataGrid framework docs + the indexing-lifecycle code (RagIndexingJobHandler:115-165, SearchIndexNameResolver, KnowledgeDocument). Run /conflict-check for the external-access + indexing BFF surfaces.</step>
    <step order="2">Schema: add sprk_documentcategory optionset (Operational/Policy/Reference-Golden, documented integers) + governance fields (status optionset Draft/InReview/Published/Retired-Expired; effective date; expiration date) on sprk_document via dataverse-create-schema. Additive only. Publish; verify via metadata query.</step>
    <step order="3">Indexing: wire category=Policy → a policy AI-Search index through SearchIndexNameResolver + sprk_ai_search_index + the allow-list in RagIndexingJobHandler (route by category). Design the routing generally (Reference-Golden documented as reusing it) but wire ONLY Policy. Do NOT build Reference indexing.</step>
    <step order="4">Governance trim: add status/effective/published fields to the policy index schema (KnowledgeDocument) + a query-time filter so an unpublished/expired policy never surfaces in retrieval. Verify with a negative retrieval test (an unpublished/expired policy is excluded).</step>
    <step order="5">Policy Library grid: author a sprk_gridconfiguration record (entity=sprk_document, filter category=Policy + published) read-only via BffDataverseClient. Do NOT hand-roll a grid.</step>
    <step order="6">Tests: KEEP-path integration tests in tests/unit/Sprk.Bff.Api.Tests/ for category→index routing + the governance-trim query filter (published surfaces, unpublished/expired excluded — negative). NO Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt; / DI-registration / ctor-null tests (ADR-038).</step>
    <step order="7">Build: dotnet publish -c Release — report compressed size + delta vs 46.90 MB. State the Placement Justification in the task notes / PR body.</step>
    <step order="8">Document the category integers, the general typed-document→typed-index→typed-grid mechanism (how Reference-Golden reuses it), and the governance-trim schema in projects/spaarke-SPA-external-access-platform-r2/notes/.</step>
    <step order="9">Update TASK-INDEX.md: set this task's status to ✅ completed.</step>
    <step order="10">Document any deviations in projects/spaarke-SPA-external-access-platform-r2/notes/.</step>
  </steps>
